## DESIGN REFERENCE FILES
The folder /design/ contains two HTML files that are the SINGLE SOURCE OF TRUTH for all UI decisions.

1. rekkomo_design_palette.html — Contains:
   - All CSS variables (copy exactly into globals.css)
   - Color palette: Royal Blue #2B4FD4 primary, Amber #F59E0B accent
   - Typography: Plus Jakarta Sans (English) + Noto Sans Devanagari (Hindi)
   - Button styles, badge styles, card styles, input styles
   - Spacing scale (4px base), border radius scale
   - DO's and DON'Ts for color usage

2. apna_sheher_ui.html — Contains:
   - Navbar component
   - Home Feed layout (3-column: sidebar + main + right panel)
   - Job cards with community badges
   - Event cards with RSVP bars
   - Onboarding wizard screens
   - Profile + Trust Score widget
   - All component states (hover, active, error, focused)

RULE: Never invent colors, fonts, spacing, or components.
Always refer to these files before writing any UI code.
